# Written by scripts/preview.render.tsx, which renders the plugin's surfaces for a
# browser to look at without the GUI.
_preview/
# Somewhere to keep a test run's full output. The runner prints to stdout and writes
# nothing itself, but a run that prints a few hundred kilobytes is worth keeping
# somewhere to read it back - and "somewhere" has to be one fixed place. A file
# invented per run and dropped in the repository root is litter that only ever shows
# up as an untracked entry in `git status`, which is not somewhere anyone looks long
# enough to act on it.
_test-output/
